                                                "sense_id": "680e643e-695c-360b-859b-72f7b1ba9d4f",
                                                "text": "In the following synopsis of the history of the United States the principal events are briefly mentioned…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b388507-bf15-4172-b4db-409fb89059e9",
                                                "sense_id": "680e643e-695c-360b-859b-72f7b1ba9d4f",
                                                "text": "A Synopsis, on the other hand, should be short enough and general enough so that a person who has not yet begun to study the language can follow it…"
